  "description": "Extracts text and fields from PDF documents, fully in .NET. Give it a PDF and an optional template JSON: with a template it aligns the page to a reference picture, cuts out each box, OCRs it (PaddleOCR) and returns the value without its printed label; without a template it returns all text in the document. Windows x64 and Linux x64. Nothing else to install.",
